      "writtenOn": "2026-06-06T15:07:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think at this point you\u0027ve gambled that there was an event pending from line 389 that would signal the fence on line 397.  I wonder if there isn\u0027t a case where the event has already been consumed before we reached 397, perhaps because the test run was backgrounded or GC\u0027d or something else caused a delay in test execution.",
      "revId": "43e1c0eadcf9d8b9f5826aa1a7da4bac982b1a51",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
